{"title":"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/8/6c88216b0f7b5ef840802257503e557dbbe1f19a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\text{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> number in the arithmetic sequence: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/7/a0757332f25069b276cb01648cd95e63ab22f546.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,5,9,13,17,21,25,...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"174\" height=\"17\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/f/42f27745a50750973dac1d79e3e76aecbc2ee1d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 397 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 399 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 401 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 403 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 405$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"421\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The common difference of this arithmetic sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/a/aca2917cfbbd78feae4efedb5eacdbe58653e0de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 - 1 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />.  From the first term, it takes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> steps to reach the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/8/6c88216b0f7b5ef840802257503e557dbbe1f19a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\text{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> term, so the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/8/6c88216b0f7b5ef840802257503e557dbbe1f19a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\text{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/c/59c5a905a09d55fa435bafb71bf8cf6330708dbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 4\\cdot99 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 397}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"171\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As in solution 1, the common difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  Recall that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/4/9a4861002f6fd7bba08e6bca4bb63449c3ff7b14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\text{th}$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> term of an arithmetic sequence with first term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and common difference <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/b/c2bdd854405d02a45ee90c2978b9215e131679eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + d(n-1) = 1 + 4(100-1) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 397}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"334\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME\" title=\"1988 AJHSME\">1988 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a 